meta {
  name: Create Daily Log - Protection & Safeguarding
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseURL}}/v1/house/:house/young-persons/:youngperson/daily-logs
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  youngperson: 1
  house: 1
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  chronology_id: 6
  safeguarding_category: Emotional
  concern_raised: Young person expressed feelings of anxiety about upcoming school exam. Appeared distressed during conversation.
  disclosure_made: YP disclosed feeling overwhelmed with schoolwork and worried about disappointing family.
  action_outcome: Reassured YP and arranged meeting with educational support coordinator. Notified social worker.
  review_date: 2026-01-12
  follow_up: Schedule follow-up meeting with school and review support plan
  mood[0]: Anxious
  mood[1]: Sad
  ~attachments[0]: @file(/path/to/incident_notes.pdf)
}

docs {
  # Create Daily Log - Protection, Behaviour and Safeguarding
  
  Create a daily log for safeguarding concerns and protective measures.
  
  ## Required Fields (Safeguarding)
  - `chronology_id` (integer): Must be 6 (Protection, Behaviour and Safeguarding)
  
  **Note:** `date`, `log_date_time`, and `day_part` are automatically set by the server.
  - `safeguarding_category` (string, required): Type of safeguarding concern
  - `concern_raised` (string, required): Description of the concern
  
  ## Optional But Recommended Fields
  - `disclosure_made` (string): Details of any disclosure by the young person
  - `action_outcome` (string): Actions taken and outcomes
  - `review_date` (date): Date scheduled for review (YYYY-MM-DD)
  - `follow_up` (string): Required follow-up actions
  - `day_part` (string): Auto-detected if not provided
  - `mood` (array): Young person's emotional state
  - `attachments` (files): Incident reports, documentation
  
  ## Safeguarding Categories
  - Physical: Physical harm, injury concerns
  - Emotional: Emotional abuse, distress
  - Sexual: Sexual abuse or exploitation concerns
  - Neglect: Neglect or lack of care
  - Bullying: Bullying incidents
  - Online Safety: Internet safety concerns
  - Exploitation: Exploitation risks
  - Other: Other safeguarding concerns
  
  ## Important Notes
  - All safeguarding logs are treated with high priority
  - Ensure appropriate staff are notified
  - Review dates should be set for follow-up
  - Maintain detailed documentation
  
  ## Response (201 Created)
  Returns the created safeguarding log with all details recorded.
}
